<tr><td>Student 2 — [NAME, ID]</td><td>Hospital requests and triage</td><td>Coordinator Agent: interprets the request objective into a structured bounded plan and delegates.</td><td>As above, including request lifecycle and orchestration evidence.</td></tr>
