<h2>3.3 Functional requirements represented in the system</h2>
<ul><li>Account registration, sign-in, refresh-token rotation/revocation and authenticated role-aware operations.</li><li>Donor profile, eligibility state and donation records; hospital registration, verification and request lifecycle.</li><li>Blood-bank locations and inventory lots with units, blood type, expiry and source; reservation, release and dispatch history.</li><li>Camp creation and lifecycle, slot capacity, bookings, roster and attendance operations.</li><li>Notification registration and delivery abstraction, including Firebase Cloud Messaging when configured.</li><li>Agent workflow initiation, status/history inspection, execution summary and administrator approve/reject/revise decisions.</li><li>Search and filters on administrative screens and API list endpoints; pagination/reporting coverage should be checked against assignment requirements before final submission.</li></ul>
